sequenceDiagram
  participant App as Application pod
  participant K8s as Kubernetes API
  participant ESO as External Secrets Operator
  participant OIDC as EKS OIDC issuer
  participant STS as AWS STS
  participant SM as AWS Secrets Manager

  ESO->>OIDC: Use projected service-account token
  ESO->>STS: AssumeRoleWithWebIdentity
  STS-->>ESO: Short-lived AWS credentials
  ESO->>SM: GetSecretValue /pharma/dev/*
  SM-->>ESO: Requested secret properties
  ESO->>K8s: Reconcile db-credentials and jwt-secret
  K8s-->>App: Inject named keys as environment variables
  Note over App,SM: Secret values never belong in Git or diagrams
